#====================================================================
# DRAFT-conan-shared-pkgconfig-requires-drop.kv
# Conan 2 shared-library 包的 STATIC 依赖被 transform_downstream 降级为
# Skipped → PkgConfigDeps 静默丢弃 .pc Requires 链
# 完整叙事与证据见同目录 .md
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT (proposed E401，最终编号由知识库主编确认)
trigger_tool:           conan|pkg-config|conan_test
phase:                  package|testing
error_signature:        'glib.h' file not found|Skipped binaries|Requires:.*dbus-glib-1 dbus|fatal error: .* file not found
severity:               2
category:               conan, pkg-config, packaging, static-linking
match_keywords:         conan, transform_downstream, shared-library, package_type, transitive_headers, PkgConfigDeps, pkg_config_name, Requires, Skipped binaries, headers=False, libs=False, skip, cpp_info.requires, not a direct requirement of the recipe, pkg-config, .pc, audclient, dbus-glib, glib
title:                  Conan 2 shared-library 包的 STATIC 依赖向下游被强制 headers/libs=False（Skipped），PkgConfigDeps 把它从生成的 .pc Requires 链静默丢弃
root_cause:             Conan 2.29.1 requires.py transform_downstream 对 shared-library 包的 STATIC 依赖向下游强制 headers=False 且 libs=False（static 中间人只丢 headers），节点被 get_transitive_requires 的 skip 过滤标记 Skipped binaries，PkgConfigDeps 据此把该依赖组件从生成的 .pc Requires: 链静默剔除，消费者 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs) 编译报 'glib.h' file not found；叠加独立坑：cpp_info.requires 组件引用只能指向 recipe 直接依赖，传递引用在 package_info() 直接报 not a direct requirement of the recipe
affected_scope:         任何 Conan 2 package_type=shared-library 配方：公共头传递 include 静态依赖公共头（audctrl.h/dbus-glib.h→glib.h），静态制品以 E236 la-free 内嵌 .so（OHOS static-only 家族），消费链走 pkg-config 流；CMakeDeps 消费链受同一 headers=False 影响（姊妹草稿 DRAFT-conan-staticlib-transitive-headers），但 .pc Requires 静默截断仅出现在 PkgConfigDeps
verification_cmd:       conan create archives/l/libaudclient/3.5-rc2 -pr:h=<abs>/ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=<abs>/ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing; 修复前日志见 Skipped binaries: glib/2.88.0 与 fatal error: 'glib.h' file not found；修复后 audclient.pc Requires 链含 glib-2.0/gobject-2.0/gthread-2.0/gmodule-2.0/gio-2.0，test_audclient 82 断言全绿
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           transitive-headers-trait-on-shared-package
rec_description:        requirements() 对被下游传递 include 的静态依赖声明 self.requires("glib/2.88.0", transitive_headers=True)：transform_downstream 按 headers=require.headers and require.transitive_headers 保留头传播，libs 保持 False 恰为正确语义（静态链已内嵌 .so，下游不应再链 glib 归档，避免双 GType）；因 cpp_info.requires 只能引用直接依赖，glib 须同时提为直接 require；expat/pcre2/zlib 无消费者可见头文件保持传递
rec_command:            self.requires("dbus-glib/0.114"); self.requires("dbus/1.14.10"); self.requires("glib/2.88.0", transitive_headers=True)  # cpp_info.requires 仅列直接依赖组件
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               manual-conan-recipe
forbid_1_pattern:       self\.cpp_info\.requires.*expat::|self\.cpp_info\.requires.*pcre2::|self\.cpp_info\.requires.*zlib::
forbid_1_reason:        cpp_info.requires 组件引用只能指向 recipe 直接依赖，传递组件引用在 package_info() 阶段即被 Conan 拒绝；无消费者可见头文件的传递依赖留在图里自然传播即可
forbid_1_consequence:   conan create 直接报 not a direct requirement of the recipe 异常
principles:
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             [E216,E221,E283,E307]
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []
